   "url": "https://www.visitwatfordcity.com/Calendar/Details/4699/Paint-Your-Own-Pottery-Open-Studio-October",
   "description": "🎃 HALLOWEEN PAINT YOUR OWN POTTERY!\n\n🎃 October 31 | 10 AM – 4 PM Get into the Halloween spirit with a fun, kid-friendly day of Paint Your Own Pottery! Walk in or pre-register to choose from a variety of pottery pieces and colors, including bowls, figurines, banks, boxes, and more. Your piece will be glazed and fired in the kiln and ready for pickup in approximately one week.\n\n👻 Pre-register and save $5 on your pottery selection! $25 – Pre-Registration $30 – Walk-Ins Larger pieces may cost more and can be paid for at the time of attendance.\n\n🎃 Halloween Specials: • Select Halloween ceramics will be 20% OFF! • Kid-friendly Halloween movies playing on the TV • Candy for our little artists! • Costumes are welcome! Please note: The 20% OFF Halloween ceramics are not included in the pre-registration discount and cannot receive an additional $5 discount. 🍦 Paint an ice cream bowl and get free ice cream at The Merc for a year! Come paint, watch some Halloween movies, enjoy some candy, and celebrate Halloween with us! No experience necessary—just bring your creativity! 👻🎨",
